<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><b><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><font color="#fff4f2">one more time</font></font></font></b></font>

31
00:01:40,490 --> 00:01:47,000
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Exceeding the Limit...</font>

32
00:01:40,490 --> 00:01:47,000
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Sasuke's Decision!!</font>

33
00:02:00,800 --> 00:02:02,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There you are!</font>

34
00:02:09,480 --> 00:02:10,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm here!</font>

35
00:02:35,090 --> 00:02:36,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm returning them to you!</font>

36
00:02:45,100 --> 00:02:46,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So it's a clone...</font>

37
00:02:52,560 --> 00:02:53,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Bastard!</font>

38
00:02:58,150 --> 00:03:01,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Uchiha... Sasuke...!</font>

39
00:03:02,070 --> 00:03:04,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why won't you come at me?!</font>

40
00:03:14,540 --> 00:03:15,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why...</font>

41
00:03:16,880 --> 00:03:18,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">do you flee?!</font>

42
00:03:20,340 --> 00:03:22,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ready?</font>

43
00:03:22,050 --> 00:03:23,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Over here!</font>

44
00:03:26,930 --> 00:03:28,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Over here!</font>

45
00:03:28,600 --> 00:03:29,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wait!</font>

46
00:03:32,020 --> 00:03:32,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Pass!</font>

47
00:03:34,110 --> 00:03:35,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here! Good one!</font>

48
00:03:36,270 --> 00:03:38,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Good! Go! Go! Go!</font>

49
00:03:45,830 --> 00:03:46,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Power shot!</font>

50
00:03:53,580 --> 00:03:54,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What're we gonna do?</font>

51
00:03:56,090 --> 00:03:59,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We don't know any wall-climbing
techniques or anything...</font>

52
00:04:10,180 --> 00:04:11,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Y-You're...</font>

53
00:04:19,650 --> 00:04:20,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This...</font>

54
00:04:20,570 --> 00:04:21,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's Gaara...</font>

55
00:04:22,240 --> 00:04:23,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Gaara of Sand...</font>

56
00:04:24,320 --> 00:04:25,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">R-Run!</font>

57
00:04:33,330 --> 00:04:34,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wait!</font>

58
00:04:34,580 --> 00:04:35,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't leave me alone!</font>

59
00:04:38,380 --> 00:04:39,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Help me!</font>

60
00:04:42,880 --> 00:04:43,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't...</font>

61
00:04:46,220 --> 00:04:47,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">want to be alone anymore!</font>

62
00:04:55,060 --> 00:04:55,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Really...</font>

63
00:04:57,310 --> 00:04:58,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No!</font>

64
00:05:04,700 --> 00:05:06,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Gaara-sama! Please calm down!</font>

65
00:05:08,530 --> 00:05:09,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yashamaru...</font>

66
00:05:45,860 --> 00:05:47,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No escape!</font>

67
00:05:48,240 --> 00:05:53,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I won't let you escape!
Uchiha Sasuke!</font>

68
00:06:13,260 --> 00:06:16,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You've gotta be kidding!
What's with that outrageous strength...?</font>

69
00:06:17,480 --> 00:06:19,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you afraid of me?</font>

70
00:06:20,980 --> 00:06:22,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's too overwhelming...</font>

71
00:06:23,610 --> 00:06:30,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Uchiha Sasuke! Are you afraid?
Are you afraid of my existence?!</font>

72
00:06:33,410 --> 00:06:37,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't forget...
You are my prey.</font>

73
00:06:40,790 --> 00:06:41,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wait!</font>

74
00:06:44,880 --> 00:06:48,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why are you fixated
on me so much?</font>

75
00:06:57,270 --> 00:06:59,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Those eyes that know true loneliness...</font>

76
00:07:03,060 --> 00:07:09,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And eyes that know that
it is the world's greatest suffering...</font>

77
00:07:10,280 --> 00:07:11,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I think I told you.</font>

78
00:07:12,240 --> 00:07:15,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That you have the same eyes as me.</font>

79
00:07:15,990 --> 00:07:17,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Eyes that lust for power,</font>

80
00:07:17,580 --> 00:07:20,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">overflowing with hatred
and murderous intent...</font>

81
00:07:23,250 --> 00:07:24,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The same as me...</font>

82
00:07:25,960 --> 00:07:29,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Eyes that burn to kill those
who drove you...</font>

83
00:07:31,590 --> 00:07:34,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">into a hell called loneliness!</font>

84
00:07:40,770 --> 00:07:41,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Such are your eyes.</font>

85
00:07:49,320 --> 00:07:50,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay. Just a minute.</font>

86
00:07:53,280 --> 00:07:54,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So you're called Gaara...</font>

87
00:07:56,950 --> 00:08:00,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't know what you know
about Sasuke, but...</font>

88
00:08:01,160 --> 00:08:02,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's not good for you to
speak as though</font>

89
00:08:02,870 --> 00:08:04,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you perceive everything about Sasuke!</font>

90
00:08:06,040 --> 00:08:08,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What is it that you want to say
to him before the final round,</font>

91
00:08:08,840 --> 00:08:10,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">by pursuing him so far?</font>

92
00:08:12,590 --> 00:08:14,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A battle is where...</font>

93
00:08:16,510 --> 00:08:19,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">another's existence and one's own
existence are put on the line...</font>

94
00:08:21,100 --> 00:08:22,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and each tries to kill the other!</font>

95
00:08:25,690 --> 00:08:30,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Only the winner can actually feel
the value of his own existence.</font>

96
00:08:30,990 --> 00:08:32,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In other words,
what you want to say is...</font>

97
00:08:32,780 --> 00:08:36,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">let's have a killing bout and
not a match?</font>

98
00:08:36,660 --> 00:08:41,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Uchiha... You really should
be wanting it, too...</font>

99
00:08:42,200 --> 00:08:44,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">in the depths of your soul...</font>

100
00:08:44,870 --> 00:08:48,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You want to confirm
the value of your existence.</font>

101
00:08:48,460 --> 00:08:51,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Am I really, truly powerful?</font>

102
00:08:52,420 --> 00:08:55,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is my existence more powerful
than my opponent</font>

103
00:08:55,260 --> 00:08:57,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">who faces me with eyes
filled with intent to kill?</font>

104
00:09:17,280 --> 00:09:18,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's the matter?!</font>

105
00:09:19,910 --> 00:09:21,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Uchiha Sasuke!</font>

106
00:09:22,450 --> 00:09:24,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you afraid of me?!</font>

107
00:09:28,540 --> 00:09:30,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Your hatred and intent to kill...</font>

108
00:09:31,380 --> 00:09:33,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">have they given way to fear?</font>

109
00:09:34,380 --> 00:09:38,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is that the extent of your existence?!</font>

110
00:09:38,760 --> 00:09:42,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Fight me... and confirm it!</font>

111
00:09:43,310 --> 00:09:46,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Your value! Your existence!</font>

112
00:09:47,270 --> 00:09:48,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Experience it!</font>

113
00:09:49,480 --> 00:09:51,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you want an answer...</font>

114
00:09:52,480 --> 00:09:53,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Come at me!</font>

115
00:10:04,700 --> 00:10:06,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I was allowed to live...</font>

116
00:10:07,620 --> 00:10:10,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Only... myself.</font>

117
00:10:11,630 --> 00:10:12,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Expressly for what reason?!</font>

118
00:10:15,590 --> 00:10:18,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No... I know the reason.</font>

119
00:10:19,590 --> 00:10:23,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The reason that man left me alive
was so he wouldn't be tormented</font>

120
00:10:23,600 --> 00:10:26,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">by a sense of guilt for having killed
an entire clan...</font>

121
00:10:28,640 --> 00:10:35,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Itachi chose me as the avenger...
in order to have me kill him!</font>

122
00:10:51,630 --> 00:10:56,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now, let me have some fun...
Uchiha Sasuke!</font>

123
00:10:59,680 --> 00:11:01,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll finish it with one blow!</font>

124
00:11:43,340 --> 00:11:45,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hurry up and die,
release yourself from your misery.</font>

125
00:11:46,680 --> 00:11:48,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You silly old fool...</font>

126
00:11:49,480 --> 00:11:53,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I believe I told you...
that you would die too!</font>

127
00:11:54,020 --> 00:11:54,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Bastard!</font>

128
00:12:03,110 --> 00:12:05,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let go, you old fool!</font>

129
00:12:05,530 --> 00:12:08,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I will not let go!
I refuse to let go...</font>

130
00:12:08,910 --> 00:12:12,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">until I have pulled out your soul!</font>

131
00:12:24,840 --> 00:12:26,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">At this rate...</font>

132
00:12:59,250 --> 00:13:00,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Gaara!</font>

133
00:13:06,800 --> 00:13:08,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Looks like it worked...</font>

134
00:13:31,990 --> 00:13:35,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see! That's what it was!</font>

135
00:13:35,250 --> 00:13:36,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's not possible...</font>

136
00:13:36,460 --> 00:13:40,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He countered Gaara's attack
in that condition?!</font>

137
00:13:45,380 --> 00:13:50,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I just realized the reason...
why it's so fun!</font>

138
00:13:51,930 --> 00:13:53,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This pain...</font>

139
00:13:54,310 --> 00:13:57,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To take down an opponent
who wounded me...</font>

140
00:13:57,520 --> 00:14:00,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and thoroughly destroy him...!</font>

141
00:14:00,150 --> 00:14:04,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That will make me truly feel alive!</font>

142
00:14:05,990 --> 00:14:10,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Gaara's never had a single wound,
but he got Gaara twice.</font>

143
00:14:11,950 --> 00:14:14,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is he... a freak?!</font>

144
00:14:15,830 --> 00:14:18,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No... a true freak is...</font>

145
00:14:20,830 --> 00:14:25,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">After all, the only thing Gaara is
transforming is still just his right arm.</font>

146
00:14:30,430 --> 00:14:32,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">More, more!</font>

147
00:14:32,810 --> 00:14:33,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

148
00:14:45,190 --> 00:14:47,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What the hell is this guy?!</font>

149
00:14:47,690 --> 00:14:49,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">One after another...</font>

150
00:14:52,570 --> 00:14:55,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here goes!</font>

151
00:14:56,910 --> 00:14:57,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's even faster!</font>

152
00:15:09,840 --> 00:15:12,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can't dodge unless
I read ahead of his movements.</font>

153
00:15:13,760 --> 00:15:16,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If I didn't have these eyes
I'd have died long ago.</font>

154
00:15:20,600 --> 00:15:21,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can no longer use Chidori...</font>

155
00:15:22,860 --> 00:15:25,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Fire Style...
Fire Ball Jutsu!</font>

156
00:15:34,200 --> 00:15:35,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So the Fire Style doesn't
work against sand...</font>

157
00:15:36,370 --> 00:15:38,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Not only that,
this level of Jutsu won't...</font>

158
00:15:39,080 --> 00:15:40,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Die!</font>

159
00:15:41,210 --> 00:15:42,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Apparently... it needs to be Chidori!</font>

160
00:16:07,070 --> 00:16:11,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well! Your limit is two shots.
That's about it...</font>

161
00:16:20,580 --> 00:16:23,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is as many Chidori
you can shoot in one day</font>

162
00:16:23,210 --> 00:16:24,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">with your present Chakra.</font>

163
00:16:25,420 --> 00:16:28,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">After all, this Chidori is a technique
that can only be used</font>

164
00:16:28,460 --> 00:16:30,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">in conjunction with Sharingan
during actual battles.</font>

165
00:16:32,090 --> 00:16:36,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But using Sharingan and
another Jutsu simultaneously means</font>

166
00:16:36,720 --> 00:16:41,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">exploding and using up the Chakra
in your body all at once.</font>

167
00:16:48,110 --> 00:16:51,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well! But you really are
one of the more impressive ones.</font>

168
00:16:52,360 --> 00:16:53,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even with my Chidori...</font>

169
00:16:53,990 --> 00:16:56,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If I use the Lightning Blade
four times in a day,</font>

170
00:16:57,240 --> 00:16:59,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'd completely use up my Chakra.</font>

171
00:17:03,250 --> 00:17:06,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What would happen if I tried
to use more than two shots?</font>

172
00:17:10,800 --> 00:17:13,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The third shot won't be activated...</font>

173
00:17:13,920 --> 00:17:15,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Remember this well!</font>

174
00:17:16,680 --> 00:17:19,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you try to force a Jutsu to activate...</font>

175
00:17:19,350 --> 00:17:21,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">not only will the Jutsu
not properly activate,</font>

176
00:17:21,720 --> 00:17:23,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but your Chakra will deplete to zero...</font>

177
00:17:24,480 --> 00:17:26,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And in the worst case, you'll die!</font>

178
00:17:29,310 --> 00:17:34,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even if you were to survive,
absolutely nothing good will come of it.</font>

179
00:17:36,280 --> 00:17:37,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Especially in your case.</font>

180
00:17:46,580 --> 00:17:47,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's the matter?</font>

181
00:17:48,540 --> 00:17:51,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Does the value of your existence
amount to only this much?</font>

182
00:17:52,630 --> 00:17:54,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll be blunt...</font>

183
00:17:54,840 --> 00:17:57,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You are... weak!</font>

184
00:18:01,680 --> 00:18:03,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're too optimistic.</font>

185
00:18:04,560 --> 00:18:06,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And it's because your hatred
is weak!</font>

186
00:18:09,480 --> 00:18:12,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The power of hatred is
the power of the intent to kill!</font>

187
00:18:13,570 --> 00:18:16,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The power of the intent to kill
is the power of revenge!</font>

188
00:18:22,950 --> 00:18:26,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Your hatred is weaker than mine!</font>

189
00:18:27,370 --> 00:18:28,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shut up...</font>

190
00:18:30,580 --> 00:18:32,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Do you understand
the meaning of this?!</font>

191
00:18:33,500 --> 00:18:34,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shut up!</font>

192
00:18:35,210 --> 00:18:39,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That means that you...
You are weaker than me!</font>

193
00:18:43,970 --> 00:18:50,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Itachi chose me to be the avenger...
to have me kill him!</font>

194
00:18:53,270 --> 00:18:54,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I am an avenger!</font>

195
00:20:11,100 --> 00:20:12,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Curse Mark again...</font>

196
00:20:20,240 --> 00:20:22,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn...! My body...</font>

197
00:20:42,380 --> 00:20:43,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke-kun!</font>

198
00:21:05,260 --> 00:21:16,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">dare datte shippai wa surunda hazukashii koto janai</font></font></font></font>

199
00:21:05,260 --> 00:21:16,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">everyone makes mistakes it's nothing to be ashamed about</font></font></font></font>

200
00:21:16,050 --> 00:21:27,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">kono kizu o muda ni shinai de waratte arukereba ii</font></font></font></font>

201
00:21:16,050 --> 00:21:27,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">don't let this scar be for naught walk with a smile</font></font></font></font>

202
00:21:37,330 --> 00:21:42,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">sou shizuka na kuuki suikomi hiroki sora ni kao age tobikomi</font></font></font></font>

203
00:21:37,330 --> 00:21:42,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">yes, breathe in the air and lift your face to the sky and jump</font></font></font></font>

204
00:21:42,930 --> 00:21:48,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">toki ni ame ga futtara hito yasumi jaa yukusaki wa kaze fuku mama ni</font></font></font></font>

205
00:21:42,930 --> 00:21:48,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">if it rains, take a break go where the wind takes you</font></font></font></font>

206
00:21:48,130 --> 00:21:53,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">takusan no matotteru koukai kono kizu o muda ni shicha shounai</font></font></font></font>

207
00:21:48,130 --> 00:21:53,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">so many regrets don't let this scar be for naught</font></font></font></font>

208
00:21:53,340 --> 00:21:56,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">ude ni kunshou kizami ikoukai shougai</font></font></font></font>

209
00:21:53,340 --> 00:21:56,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">let's go carve the in our chest</font></font></font></font>

210
00:21:56,970 --> 00:21:58,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">sou kokkara ga SHOW TIME</font></font></font></font>

211
00:21:56,970 --> 00:21:58,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">yes, it's show time, life begins now.</font></font></font></font>

212
00:21:58,480 --> 00:22:08,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">dare datte shippai wa surunda hazukashii koto janai</font></font></font></font>

213
00:21:58,480 --> 00:22:08,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">everyone makes mistakes It's nothing to be ashamed about</font></font></font></font>

214
00:22:08,950 --> 00:22:19,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">kono kizu o muda ni shinai de waratte arukereba ii</font></font></font></font>

215
00:22:08,950 --> 00:22:19,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">don't let this scar be for naught walk with a smile</font></font></font></font>

216
00:22:19,500 --> 00:22:29,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">kanashimi mo kaze ni kaete tsuyoku susunde ikereba ii</font></font></font></font>

217
00:22:19,500 --> 00:22:29,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">transform sadness into the wind and continue to forge on</font></font></font></font>

218
00:22:29,790 --> 00:22:35,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">tsuyoku susunde ikereba ii</font></font></font></font>

219
00:22:29,790 --> 00:22:35,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">forge on strong</font></font></font></font>

220
00:22:47,590 --> 00:22:51,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Hey Yashamaru,
what does pain feel like?</font>

221
00:22:51,890 --> 00:22:54,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">I don't know because
I've never been injured...</font>

222
00:22:55,020 --> 00:22:57,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">I was wondering what it's like.</font>

223
00:22:58,560 --> 00:23:02,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Could it be that I'm hurt?</font>

224
00:23:02,650 --> 00:23:06,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">I'm not bleeding, but my chest's
felt weird for a long time.</font>

225
00:23:07,190 --> 00:23:11,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">It feels stifled and it hurts a lot!</font>

226
00:23:11,990 --> 00:23:14,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Next time:
"Assassin Under the Moonlight."</font>

